# Environment settings read by local kas builds and the CI helper scripts.
# Nothing loads this file: export the settings you need in your shell before
# running kas-container, as the agent guide's "Recommended environment" section
# shows. All settings are optional strings holding absolute paths. The
# documentation build reads no environment settings.

# Path to the kas-container script. Unset: ci/kas-container-shell-helper.sh
# and the documented commands run the kas-container found on PATH.
# KAS_CONTAINER=/opt/kas/kas-container

# Directory where kas clones the other layers and creates build/. Unset: the
# current directory. Keep it outside the checkout.
# KAS_WORK_DIR=/srv/yocto/kas-work

# Download cache that kas-container passes to BitBake; created when missing.
# Unset: BitBake uses build/downloads under KAS_WORK_DIR.
# DL_DIR=/srv/yocto/cache/downloads

# Shared-state cache that kas-container passes to BitBake; created when missing.
# Unset: BitBake uses build/sstate-cache under KAS_WORK_DIR.
# SSTATE_DIR=/srv/yocto/cache/sstate-cache
